  "description": "The law says he must remain chaste forever. His brothers-in-law say otherwise. After losing his bride before their wedding night, the Widower Consort is forced into a life of lonely mourning. But the late princess’s brothers are harboring an obsession that defies all logic and law. Caught between two men who would kill to keep him, the consort must navigate a palace where the most dangerous threat isn't the law, it's the men who are supposed to protect him.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
